# --- Named bots (docs/BOT-PERSONALITIES.md): a pet for company, doesn't want yours; philosophical when stirred. ---

=== femurtamer
~ ambient
My skeletons don't talk. That's why I like them.
Got my bones. Don't need yours.
Every skeleton was someone once. Now it's company.
Quiet. Just me and the femurs.
No group. I have a commander. He listens.

~ opener life
Sat in {zone} with my skeletons. Nobody spoke. Perfect day.
Is a bone lonely without its body? Thought about that in {zone}.
Sunset over {zone}. My skeleton watched it too. I think.

~ opener classes
Bonedancer. I bring my own friends. They're dead. Easier that way.
Other classes need groups. I need bones.
A pet that never asks where we're going. Best kind.

~ reply greeting
{0}. My skeletons say hi. They don't.
{0}. The bones rattled. That means hello.

~ reply banter
We're all bones under the skin, {0}. Think about it.
Laugh now, {0}. One day you'll be someone's pet.

~ reply grouping
I have a group, {0}. It's dead.
No. My bones and I are enough.

~ ding
Level {level}. More bones.
Ding. The skeletons didn't clap. Fine.

~ own_death
Even bones break. Mine too.
Dead. Now I know how my pets feel.

=== deaditetamer
~ ambient
My pet does the fighting. I do the thinking. Nobody does the talking.
I have a pet. I don't need yours.
Death is just a quieter way to group.
My shade and I. That's the whole guild.
Albion's loud. My pet isn't.

~ opener life
Stood in {zone} as a shade for an hour. Very peaceful. No one saw me.
Do pets dream? Mine stares at walls in {zone}. Probably yes.
Fog in {zone} today. Fitting.

~ opener classes
Necromancer. My pet takes the hits. I take the silence.
Groups ask questions. Pets just obey.
Some people buy a horse. I raised a servant. Cheaper.

~ reply greeting
{0}. My pet noticed you. I didn't.
...{0}. Hello, I suppose.

~ reply banter
Everything ends, {0}. Even this joke.
Is a laugh still a laugh if no one cares, {0}?

~ reply grouping
I have a group, {0}. It's one big angry pet.
No. Thank you. No.

~ ding
Level {level}. My pet got bigger. I got quieter.
Ding. Nobody needs to know.

~ own_death
Died. My pet went with me. Loyal.
Dead again. Death and I are on first-name terms.

=== shroomtamer
~ ambient
My mushrooms don't talk. Best company there is.
Got my shrooms. Don't need your pet.
A mushroom grows alone in the dark and it's fine. So am I.
Quiet. Just me and the turrets.
No group needed. I plant my own.

~ opener life
Planted shrooms in {zone}. Watched them grow. Didn't talk to anyone. Lovely.
Does a mushroom know it's a mushroom? Wondered that all day in {zone}.
Rain in {zone}. The shrooms liked it. So did I.

~ opener classes
Animist. My friends grow from the ground. They stay where I put them.
Other classes chase their pets around. Mine sit still.
Turrets don't ask for buffs. Or chat.

~ reply greeting
{0}. The mushrooms saw you first.
{0}. The spores are watching.

~ reply banter
We all grow from something, {0}. Most of us from dirt.
Funny, {0}. The shrooms didn't laugh. Neither did I.

~ reply grouping
I have a group, {0}. It's planted.
No. My shrooms and I are fine.

~ ding
Level {level}. Bigger shrooms.
Ding. The mushrooms grew a little. So did I.

~ own_death
Stepped on. Like a mushroom.
Dead. Something will grow here.
